loom qa=fleet_round_open.sh before=75 after=83 qa=fleet_round_open_witness.rish before=85 mid=71 after=91
file tools/f/fleet_round_open.sh step 4's else branch attempts git rebase xy/main and parks only on refusal; head sentences shortened, no claim moved
file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_round_open_control.sh legs A, B and C plant the diverged state three ways -- lost race, colliding rewrite, dropped duplicate; 17 -> 34 legs
file tools/f/fleet_round_open_witness.rish two new invariants read the re-derivation clause and the planted state from the files themselves; header cites the roster instead of a stale count
file construction/REDS.md %503 booked, %499 closed by it, headline re-derived to 502 rows
file construction/archive/REDS-the-test-that-cannot-fail-rows-499-503.md both rows folded, one story told twice
