file construction/ITINERARY.md live front carries this round; roster contention sized for Keaton
recommend check in (Keaton) -- eight ships each run a tier-lap roster of 150 guards on one 4-core pier, and mine cost 1,019s against 789s unloaded. Guard cost now scales ships x guards with nothing staggering it. Whether the roster stays tier lap on every seat, or the fleet staggers, is a fleet-shape call rather than a lap's.
